      "text": "In January, we shared with you the story of Grapan GATBEL who was arrested outside the Douglas County Courthouse for acting in a menacing behavior with a fake handgun. In his words he was 'trying to \"flex\" on deputies'. He was charged with disorderly conduct, false reporting, possession of drug paraphernalia, and FELONY failure to register as a sex offender. The Sheriff has confirmed that GATBEL has had an ICE detainer placed upon him. After GATBEL's release from corrections, he will be turned over to Immigration and Customs Enforcement. DCSO will continue to work cooperatively with all of our federal partners to remove dangerous criminals from our community.",
